<title>SPAIN: Spanish retail sales up 5.44 pct y/y in April.</title>
<headline>Spanish retail sales up 5.44 pct y/y in April.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish retail sales data for April 1997 showed a 5.44 pct year on year rise versus the same month one year ago, and a 5.23 pct rise over March, national statistic institute INE said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>INE gave the following breakdown, April 1997 (provisional):</p>
<p>				     vs March 1997	 vs April 1996</p>
<p>    General Index		   5.23		   5.44</p>
<p>    Food				3.85		   0.85</p>
<p>    Personal goods		  3.67		   5.89</p>
<p>    Household goods		 7.01		   9.48</p>
<p>    Other consumer goods	  8.65		  13.06</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
